+### Task and mesh shaders in NVN2 BNSH program slots 7 and 8
+
+- **Symptom:** models missing from a scene (a door, foliage) with no draw logged as failed; `[RED] shader <key> is not in the shader map` for keys whose instructions are in the game's `.bfsha` files, and `[RED] DrawMeshTasks without its task and mesh shaders (task - mesh -): draw skipped`.
+- **Cause:** an NVN2 BNSH program has stage slots past the six of NVN (vs, hs, ds, gs, ps, cs at program +8 to +0x30): slot 7 (+0x40) holds the task shader and slot 8 (+0x48) the mesh shader, with the same stage records. `bnsh_shaders` read the six slots alone, so a mesh-shaded program kept only its pixel shader, and the host never found the other two.
